This adds a new web-category tool called "URL Defang". This tool is really aimed at system admins or security researchers needing a fast and simple way to defang urls. 

[Why Defang - http://defang.me](https://defang.me/why.php)

```
// domain.tld -> domain[.]tld
// www.domain.tld -> www.domain[.]tld
// http://domain.tld -> http[:]//domain[.]tld
// https://domain.tld -> https[:]//domain[.]tld
// ftp://ftp.domain.tld/path/to/file -> ftp[:]//ftp.domain[.]tld/path/to/file
// http://me:pwd@it-tools.tech:3000/url-parser?key1=value&key2=value2#the-hash -> http[:]//me:pwd@it-tools[.]tech:3000/url-parser?key1=value&key2=value2#the-hash
```
